{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1379,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b548d5b10c04a4f8bd2c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "突然觉得很怀念刚入学的时候呢……\r\n虽然那时的圣王就已经是一流的了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "325f98c96e339f46eea813c80342de70a1ce62f4f9119fe8c711761760a6e83e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0340351c18b931c595095b82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼，好热。\r\n你去问问看手纲小姐，\r\n看能不能调低冷气的温度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ce584f46bea9289f76b543bb660ccb4b37d4400bab0194043f8270e6c35a26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8466bc9d8e5f4f1d227d6a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "观赏美丽事物的时候得注意才行。\r\n真是的……银杏的气味\r\n怎么这么难弄掉啊……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "acdf2e0500feb1504c928c882d84b05e70efd60d8006e4a21fd6b58913ec243d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbea416a996f6db0614b5de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗手、漱口，这都是一定要做的。\r\n保湿、保温，加上洗温热的澡，\r\n这些全都做到才能维持一流的\r\n健康身体！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef2f85410cade17df9e02a684d304e07eae1b9aa6d2a61eb29e2d5716b62b0f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170fcddbdcc302d0d4b5b1eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安，可不能说还想睡喔。\r\n来，我来声援你。\r\n张开眼睛！加油！加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec9a1d588bd9f03ea6a732fdaea6a4a88eb2e4848cf1855c952152c9d72a6e45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879e02f3bb118df7e6ac25b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～呼～喘、不过气……川上……\r\n用蛮力……折断扫把……要去找、\r\n总务商量……一早就……真是的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e48e147a79c8e7ad90aafae564669773e80b1597066a80ce4ea8148d31bddeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b87505649d508a3d0cc698",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，想约我吃午餐的话明日请早。\r\n今天我已经跟素质约好了……\r\n咦？没要约？喔～这样啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d63f867feab0e5fc074cc626cc25d8719d5edf9e92e18c0d37c8b96e6c111d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b87958b05b1d5962d1e2739c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也差不多上完课了，接下来\r\n就是我跟你的两人时间呢。\r\n我们可要认真以赴喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04ca162080d5f2768d85df4b18b33e002c93a0c9c5c28ae7bf20bf4b7ac042d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ed5949c662d20a5c1258ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔～呵呵呵！就算这时间我的喉咙\r\n状态仍然完美！还想听更多\r\n圣王的美声吗？一定很想听对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58119ff887d3c3ff83137eb440639844451858818cf78fa817b367e4b4d50416",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84f0c7019e3a50cfad1414f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作到这么晚真是辛苦了。你说\r\n不用我帮忙？在你面前的赛马娘\r\n可是超顶尖助手耶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f56438c61d2078ca86a127bac20df1799a285cf4a6d53b97e093006d1efabb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfab769ee5335bdea299d769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我越是大显身手，粉丝的脸色\r\n就会因为狂热而潮红……好，\r\n去将他们染上优美的红色吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1006c08efbca6ecbcae9c54e866d4b4e99f7c7c51be16734ae69b1beeb29a6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dbeb35270a3e2ae66f68798",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～无须多言我也知道。\r\n你是带着圆扇来为圣王搧风的对吧？\r\n那么……请开始～",
      "source_fingerprint": "efdb9aecbb1b4a333baa94cd11d1f8a55c5d99853791d397898c5c1deb8c4fc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786406dca3cf0673733048f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来外面的金木犀开花了呢。\r\n你看……在你的肩膀上。呵呵，\r\n圣王可是连观察力都很敏锐的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd37d4211a91d6b4ff5a8af7aeafeaa909c74dad84909025ae0e94cc4ad9892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07325e66c4a7d0ad9a582d18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "第三学期比第二学期短很多喔。\r\n采取行动时得随时设想到未来目标。\r\n不过，我的计划随时都很完美啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dd9a1b4e02ac93242ff0bcea2edda06cb3c5c43c6a583fd32c43eca1ff4bc90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f04b6a2079a8dd009df73a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f2566f6931512c11e70a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63637d6b9fe5f5634775abbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あなた朝はご飯？それともパン派？\r\nどちらにせよ、一流たるもの\r\n朝も優雅に過ごしたいものね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69a7a5d7db25114340aa20322dedce05e7a474f8962c4852b9b350d8a488bab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3212de630086b44611b6152",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら、キングの横に立つなら\r\nもう少しシャキッとしなさい。\r\n寝ぼすけ顔なんかき・ん・し！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1aa5cf4696c9b626b31783ecf5219090bfe6288e455a9e67e5e15cec6cf6c33f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f036c3b63e833d9b3b426c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さ！休日に行くカフェの下見よ！\r\nどこに座るか、何を頼むか…\r\n一挙一動にこだわるのが一流よ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfaa741749cd4d630e4b764734d567aef0653c70d7ad6de1bbb7c48c06ef7ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8dbd0c459b272399f79222c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休み時間はヒマがないのよ…みんな\r\nこぞってドレスを褒めるんだもの！\r\n聞くのに忙しくて！おーっほっほ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "486e404fde64b3735fd0309adf986ff9cb5b33a20473e6a118b48f1c29bf84a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a9e0c4a25cccdc745572817",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呆れた…まだやっているの？はぁ…\r\n仕方ないわね。明日のトレーニング\r\nの準備は私がしておいてあげるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eaef52933e0cecffe59f4fd5bd83d8abdd4d1ccaf69675c266f121c76eeac633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dbd9cfadb7981bc1a812b74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あら、もうこんな時間…しっかり\r\nキングを寮までエスコートして\r\nくれるんでしょうね？ふふっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf307ada8bcdafe40441f8deb4d5045cdd72a30da5f533f76206ee973eb38fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d216780a0f05cf90668e38a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新入生たちが集まっちゃって…\r\nバージンロードみたいだったわ。\r\nふふっ、憧れであり続けたいわね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97f63f27b9f1171d182f991c848f6276cfc93e96ded3eb439bd3d80002f2536d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105a46d8fa14f9f67264b910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雨も暑さもドレスの一部として\r\n着こなしてみせる…\r\nそれが一流の所作というものよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15b0f3c35bfca8eca388f0f18890319df9fc6ad27e3838a65221a124059076f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:520a3521d59ecfa13349764a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小さい頃、菊のお茶を仕入れて、\r\n飲んだ事もあったわね…願掛けの\r\n効能はともかく、いい味なのよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f34292528374d6f181a8974d8879ffa2521a56c1480ac48b6ce9fa847d6c06e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5629e0c02c50a9782e5c5859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぅ…こ、この衣装、雪景色に\r\n映えそうじゃないかしら…！\r\nは…は…はくちゅん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d882fe40f849033f26ae6c8b275e9fb1cf360917a3eb6bdc6ea411cdbcf97d7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f06905751c808766bc3acb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン",
      "source_fingerprint": "205aa64f55aa5b5868c584cadc0b5dcd8e05b84b0a76c8efb1da86986277c562",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf0ea35a0c213a38313f2d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然宿舍真的很吵……\r\n但回家都有人的这种生活，\r\n我并不讨厌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c13301e3a071cd8da400e6279f7e7f1038e3aa5aa649637690172d4b8b19150b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fdf8fb07031fb16e1f7021f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵♪川上来请我指导礼仪呢。\r\n竟然还知道要来拜托我……\r\n那孩子还挺懂事的嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8167a33cc118eee78ef6619f787935e401353a1c15396d48efcb7e92b3a48056",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ad2603137b0062eee7e667a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…就只有沙土我跑不习惯。\r\n沙尘太多了，大家就不能\r\n优雅一点跑吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bf7356e5ca6d0988438d761c0be725ddfbf2bf217e9e849de22126178f769b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98288884de6d5a2871676517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定要以世界格局去注意信息。\r\n毕竟圣王随时都有可能\r\n收到外国的邀约嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e477d688c70f214f984ed5478f7aa6d88a8e9e97201423621516f3bd6b8c8013",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f29f757ea7b5c379f784d07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不知道为什么，特别周总是让人无法\r\n不去注意她……因为我是很会\r\n照顾人的优秀赛马娘的缘故吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f227c8bc968606038cd1bcba4a4be7bedfcb7bb70f8abb91cce87dade097207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bc3e27a6192173fef34fc5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把Live舞台装饰得很美丽\r\n也是一流赛马娘的工作哦。\r\n就像一直都这么努力的我一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a70c4f022c02c42e17c19787726a26ee76b5169d877a33bad218b96afd2bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:740fe6191ef1c37be11c0b77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算穿着跟别人一样的衣服，\r\n我也会穿得比谁都好看。\r\n这就是圣王呀！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "932c66481b542e3df4153a1e4cdde070fa7fac433925b0b7486b87f06f718252",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fed50b6f92492e6ab93dad24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵、呵，这就是我的决胜服……\r\n只特地！为我所准备的！决胜服！\r\n啊啊，听起来真是美妙啊……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dbbbb12647c0f0a8d418d130bba4a3cd72fce464cc082cd957eac3b2bcad4f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32d1d4ff71dff31ba5fa8ea7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要一直赢、不停地赢下去……\r\n绝对要向世人证明我的才能。\r\n我从不需要任何退路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d15165e84effc14dc2eed0761e7a906f9a013b2efb8762a33d46f112df1f2de1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b77a75ceaa6903f489193ff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春丽同学又睡昏了头，\r\n钻到别人被窝里睡了诶！？\r\n被她弄得真的是好难睡着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b5a54d923e42915d9754c8d593b19e261fe4b5d68a8674cfce5f72620ca9f24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0b9645b204e9515e764e7ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你如果有看到天空同学要告诉我。\r\n今天我一定要让她\r\n陪我做下午的并跑练习……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e53501c9cf86106a885bf194d60834c760e39bfbc390cca75f022ebd10ba30b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9849983bf302e2c6ca98bc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要熬夜也是可以的。\r\n前提是不影响明天的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb1bc351f21da5c28e847a25aa3da361af44f4936902f840d890fd80c6d78a10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ddb34820872346eb7bba97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耐寒的花朵开始绽放之时，\r\n便是我才能开花之刻！\r\n代表……没错！现在就是圣王的成长巅峰期！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f46a1d0d09df6ccfd9a028bca742e297683eee3b7c07e97efc160c943f6fd6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53db7d980282c6033de8f9e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要是敢提出说鬼故事来解暑\r\n这种蠢方法，我可是会生气的。\r\n……我会一辈子都不理你的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc1ea6b5ab38cd8570ecddc7f512106450c82dcb6de811b336b251fca8e55a32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ac01f78c541896b2aaeb46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……应该什么时候\r\n准备换季的衣服好呢……\r\n这个时期穿衣服真的很麻烦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffe3b05911c052af43fbf4db8df4a4524d19a6c603bebe065f9335298f4130c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f21faa1206d0a927bd8f6ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "安禅不必须山水，灭得心中火自凉\r\n……就是一直喊冷才会觉得冷的。\r\n所以只要喊说温暖就会……阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1b4505fb6aaf49acd43ab5679db638558196bff23a772d91a056aaff3fd7c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879fe145502b40a015d7e730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套衣服看运动竞赛也不错呢。\r\n你喜欢哪种竞赛呢？\r\n……除了我的比赛以外的啦！笨蛋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbc578437e44632190a1e8f8d1f0c77a73347c6bf780b0b86f3de77f37631f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7de2f20a8ccc35d5e6953ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵──呵呵呵！哦──呵呵呵！\r\n喔──呵呵呵！……请作答，何者是\r\n圣王的正确笑声？你一定知道吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "99860fa6f0f77318e5b0de01d81eb228589b3c26451ad2e38220596d18366b18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a850bd47a60e52fc0781b203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采珠前辈跟青竹两人都很有个性，\r\n但实力也是真材实料。之前与她们\r\n一起并跑练习时我亲身见识到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83bb79e7c55c39c950d5a9a0713f418ab3bb133bb25e3675be4f6e770c706e76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be956036b20d0b3d3f3e718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当我将这职务交接出去的那一天，\r\n你会说些什么呢？虽然说……\r\n那一天还相当遥远啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beb07fb2992bbc289a3d936926e769e096e2a247d3b2a187cd6f33bf4daa82a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c926abede53dbb711a0cb70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特别周跟川上下次补考总该\r\n合格了吧……我以后再也不想\r\n陪她们读书了喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8c9850e8a9a70f70119745fa21b9333660d4a4ce76ee47b4a015228016411f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f12e39ff72404ad38364741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条头带可不会轻易松开喔。\r\n今天早上乌拉拉替我\r\n绑得紧～紧的……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a028916fc4597594746c6417dd884f1ccd0f1db3f23a6cee163153db39dcd65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c59dd545826c47143ca3b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想休息放松时请跟我说。\r\n我将赋予你准备两人份甜食的权利，\r\n以保我们能够继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba43a969c2437f3f27a6c9f7cfa582a2b511c4d78ca1848b047fbfbda24b439a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a3815e03093978fe52a3b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发尾有点失去卷度了……\r\n毕竟下午的练习也很严苛呢，\r\n等一下得重新卷好才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3632aef346c44eca598e8193943459506104850d80d27b3607fb1edc585155",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd767ae5eb21ef1015354de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在感谢祭上也一样……请注意言行，\r\n别在支持我的粉丝前丢脸喔？毕竟\r\n你是我这一流赛马娘的签约训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09be6785d7251f466af334c1f1bb5198a560d8085842c18ac12504685b9b3849",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c90988ce3a861bc57551bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……就算再热……！\r\n这套服装就是要\r\n配上手套才算完美……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3cc14d97dec31557258eff611485c7a1c9ff3f42f33258f1978564abf68b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72fd90e0349ec42f8240377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正值艺术之秋，听场管乐演奏会吧？\r\n舞台上的音色与观众席的不同，\r\n听起来别有一番乐趣……非常棒喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0303f151e7ccd922b0537dbd51e0ea9c10b7856b1c46fd9167af1a06317a6dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e2927e64c84871cb1a471b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……是不是拿掉第二个钮扣比较好？\r\n数码偶尔会用热烈的眼神看我，\r\n嘴里念着「钮扣还在」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7bc15feae4406638fd545f9589e61180b6dbe81b77b334bc19527b640748907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58927e4f25d0d08159cd97d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想听圣王为你加油？可以啊！\r\n去准备太鼓吧！……快点啊，\r\n事前准备都是你的职责吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9532e746edcc21c8be7e0b661f94a8d464d092fa30d7cfc41e72b7b85a66fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058eabf026d2757470a3bc6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「服装是心灵的装束，高贵的颜色能\r\n使心灵更高贵」……曾有人这么告诉\r\n我。虽然我猜那个人应该不记得了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2def8177000101ef031f80a5d4edf20166747a2d5aff787a984b76211888e544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc60c2537c9bd1181aba5b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タオルケットとかないかしら？木陰\r\nでクラフトさんが寝てて。風邪でも\r\nひいたら大変でしょうに…まったく",
      "source_fingerprint": "2224e86295d544d0cbebfb3931d39cea30cc027e6f22c1656313e88736a30a6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9997247fc296bdadeb19a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いまだにオフのシーザリオさんに\r\n話しかけられると脳が処理でき\r\nないのよね…早く慣れないと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05763d4a179fe05a332938335671106945d3f9f69769cbfeda2c5497dc2c7be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac01638fc21990ece864c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "己の筋を是が非でも通すために、\r\n決して譲らない姿勢…！\r\nスイープさん、いいじゃない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54855b032a8d03cc0506af19a0b9a38e77af8b64eb133bbff7b7c6b8d04ee13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ba312a78df995135b53f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待に応えつつ、いい意味で期待を\r\n裏切らなければならない…\r\n大変よね、ヴィルシーナさん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b265726558a38f42918a6622ec73d8fed01f19616ecf4eb4cba63b63e888c021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff860212bb499453f95c3474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワカミさんがせっかく考えて\r\nくれたポーズですものね…\r\n一流のポーズ…んん～…えいっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82ca77feb68b24e682d64e773fde617e8f268d1bef733d771fed711bde9c146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be05cb5e03fae9615e1f556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遠くからでも私とわかる？当然ね！\r\nキングは、朝日よりも輝いて…え？\r\nアクセサリーが反射してるだけ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5fcdbe5f6ada5b9058953b7ca809754bb9bd58463781ca4b3b50696ac1cd3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4c0080fa9f90753b5e5239d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼の量には気を使わないと…\r\nこの衣装、食べ過ぎるとすぐに\r\nラインに出ちゃうのよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46292716e6a58aeb2805fceabd0c975e378e35ce77c0fa27f2a9b0e681112326",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeda1d588badccd07be9cd76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "装飾が光を反射するから、夜半の\r\nトレーニングも安心…な、わけない\r\nでしょ！なんだと思っているの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f487159dd922712a6b3b61e38b46119ed767705e9687f2fbe7e762e24dfb120d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8882e52b19e8318b3e27714f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブーケの花にも一流のこだわりを。\r\nせっかくなら春に咲く、\r\n生き生きとした花がいいわね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd03c0931e1ee446c6de5f27aa536533fc2a68a454a443dad157767fefdd75e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959eaded55a140bc9262b084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真夏の太陽もキングの衣装の前では\r\n引き立て役に過ぎないわ！…って\r\n白飛びしちゃう！日陰に行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc00a6a62526f90fb3b19163944a5495f49b1a8cc8fb2004ee930347d8b9d184",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f191d68e2a884c04a4af03df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は次の年に向けて栄養を蓄える\r\n季節でもあるの！コツコツ積み重ね\r\n来年も大輪の花を咲かせるわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "324fef4835a55d7bf381069d2888f16f5c2954f7c0070f8a1505083abc632070",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b2f39ec67102ce1977ef786",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流は寒い日の起床だって\r\n常勝であるべき！布団から出るのが\r\n辛いなら、叩き起こしてあげるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d089feca786f02ccf4f0177d7d04ef6256e6d4925653f661c21e07bb327cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58e34b8a2faf3ead49805ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "細かい注文を何度もしちゃった\r\nけれど、妥協や諦めはしたくない。\r\nこれこそが、私のドレスよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4aa505aac3143acf4f4c95561b2b9e395a7a96b4230f315c0dd2776b1d4845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603cc788ee805fe827a5c5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ成長の余地のあるデザインよ…\r\nでも『私』は気に入っているの！\r\nたとえあの人がなんと言おうとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f0b0f6ebc5b96548d6dff6f92f21b87a16b1e161cce8f540cb60beb076a43c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1e176eed9a095faf730027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是圣王的训练啊。\r\n你当然是准备了一流的计划\r\n来的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd11b5ad18968711de69c623cae410673283048c07ed87bdcde6313f9ebab5df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c55bbdbe774b6aaed30c8d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくわよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64856ba922376708d285340e268f38bbc0ce8ec2f37c154d0c625bbb54b632d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f112cfa1bdfd91fdfb87cc2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快，开始吧。\r\n我已经做好了完美的准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f23617cb850c21a8b87472fae6c688971e71d66cd789660fba3363e604512a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fbf49f4da3aaf6f96049cd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣王的时间是连一秒都不可以浪费的。\r\n我可没赋予你浪费时间的权利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4de9b9be20b4873a0428ba7da937c7bb7681240d98ca99f6bf6db64c376f789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90736e67c95e4c096ff32664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵、呵，\r\n让你看看什么叫作差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cda7b0711da640f484863f7844fb86427125ed1505da0ea86c5d4969e6753b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63b142be456de5cc0004d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不停下脚步，\r\n就一定能掌握荣耀。\r\n我是这么坚信着的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a21da0899541f9ae6a12625f3b46060377affd878f7533fa66f52c519bb688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33695689cf28fa1451356c3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要得到所有人的认可，\r\n就必须在所有人都看不到的\r\n地方也持续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e06b381bd2a9750ae34bc3fd3005130fbda642c2c4059683f4874b3caa8fc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8c0814415488aa7acd005d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？看起来很完美的圣王\r\n其实还没有完全成形呢。\r\n也就是我还有成长空间的意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2f7186a319af0c7eefed3dfb3cc0e39c700161f87f9703ba0b80b9a24a9dcc4",
